# Claude and outputs
wandb/*
# `outputs/*` rather than `outputs/`: git cannot re-include a path whose PARENT
# directory is excluded, so a directory pattern here makes the exception below
# impossible to express.
outputs/*
!outputs/ckpts/
outputs/ckpts/*
# EXCEPTION - this one is a FIXTURE, not an output. It is the checkpoint
# tests/golden_omt/capture_golden_omt.py pins, and the fixtures captured from it
# are tracked (658 KB each) while the 3.9 MB checkpoint was not - so the repo's
# best bitwise gate could not run on a clean clone and passed only on local
# state. Same class of defect as the data/obs_bank 2-of-246 split.
!outputs/ckpts/pRNN_lroom_cur_noObs_26-02-15-17-33-11/
# docs/ is TRACKED (reorganised 2026-08-12 into claude_logs/ legacy/ results/
# exp_instructions/). docs/sab_context/ became tracked on 2026-08-25: it is
# cited from Configs/run/multienv.yaml, Configs/performance/ultra.yaml,
# tests/perf/benchmark.py and a figure generator that carried its numbers as
# source literals. Untracked and load-bearing is the worst combination.

# Generated observation banks: rebuilt automatically per (env, object position)
# by curious_george/envs/obs_bank.py, keyed on a grid fingerprint.
data/obs_bank/
storage/*
tests/perf/results/*.prof

# EXCEPTION: the checkpoint tests/golden_omt/capture_golden_omt.py pins.
# It is a FIXTURE, not an output. The fixtures beside it are tracked (658 KB
# each) while the 3.9 MB checkpoint they were captured from was not, so the
# repo's best bitwise gate could not run on a clean clone - it passed only on
# local state. Same class as the data/obs_bank 2-of-246 split.
!outputs/ckpts/
!outputs/ckpts/pRNN_lroom_cur_noObs_26-02-15-17-33-11/
